<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Daehan buys 21,000T of wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Daehan buys 21,000T of wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daehan Flour Mills Co Ltd said on Tuesday it bought 21,000 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat from Japanese trading house Mitsui and Company Ltd.  </p>
<p>A Daehan official said shipment was set for March 5-April 5 to the western port of Inchon.</p>
<p>Details as follows:</p>
<p>  Type of Wheat	     Tonne	Price/T (FOB)</p>
<p>  Soft White		  9,000	 $149.70</p>
<p>  Soft White		  1,500	 $151.90</p>
<p>(protein max 10 percent)</p>
<p>  Hard Red Winter	   2,500	 $179.80</p>
<p>  Dark Northern Spring    8,000	 $178.50</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
